{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"OBA","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"俄巴底亞書","commonName":"俄巴底亞書","title":"俄巴底亞書","order":31,"numberOfChapters":1,"sha256":"6ed119d3835c85d71a499bded152ab8006d4bad87a01cfe8c2bef66b00cd8e42","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/OBA/1.json","lastChapterNumber":1,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/OBA/1.json","totalNumberOfVerses":21},"chapter":{"number":1,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["以下是俄巴底亞看到的異象。",{"lineBreak":true},{"lineBreak":true},"耶和華懲罰以東",{"text":"我們從耶和華那裡聽到消息，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"有位使者被派去對列國說：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「起來，我們去攻打以東吧！」","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"關於以東，主耶和華說：","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「看啊，我要使你在列國中最弱小，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"備受藐視。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你住在巖穴中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"居住在高山上，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"自以為誰也不能把你拉下來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但你的驕傲欺騙了你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"即使你如鷹高飛，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在星辰間搭窩，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我也必把你拉下來。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"text":"「盜賊夜間來你家，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"難道不只偷所需要的嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"人們到你那裡摘葡萄，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"難道不留下幾串嗎？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"但你會被徹底毀滅！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以掃","poem":1},{"noteId":0},{"text":"要被洗劫一空，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他藏的珍寶要被搜去。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的盟友將你逐出家園；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的朋友欺騙你，戰勝你；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的知己設陷阱害你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你卻懵然不知。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華說：「到那天，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要毀滅以東的智者，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"除掉以掃山上的明哲。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"提幔的勇士必驚慌失措，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以掃山上的人盡遭殺戮。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["懲罰以東的原因"]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"text":"「因你曾殘暴地對待同胞兄弟雅各，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你必蒙羞，永遭毀滅。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"當外人掠奪雅各的財物、","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"異族攻入耶路撒冷的城門抽籤分贓時，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你竟然袖手旁觀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"就像他們的同夥一樣。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的親族遭難之日，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你不該幸災樂禍；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"猶大人被滅的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你不該興高采烈；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們遭難的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你不該口出狂言；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我子民遭難的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你不該闖進他們的城；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們遭難的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你不該幸災樂禍；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們遭難的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你不該趁火打劫；","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你不該站在路口截殺那些逃亡者；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他們遭難的日子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你不該把倖存者交給仇敵。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"text":"「耶和華懲罰萬國的日子近了。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"必按你的所作所為報應你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的惡行必落到自己頭上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"猶大人在我的聖山上怎樣飽飲憤怒，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"萬國也要照樣不停地喝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"且要大口吞下，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"直到他們完全消逝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"heading","content":["以色列的復興"]},{"type":"verse","number":17,"content":[{"text":"「然而，錫安山必成為避難所，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"成為聖地。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各家必得到自己的產業。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":18,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"雅各家將成為火，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"約瑟家將成為烈焰，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以掃家將成為碎稭，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被火焚燒、吞噬，無一人逃脫。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"這是耶和華說的。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":19,"content":[{"text":"「南地的人將佔領以掃山；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"丘陵的人將佔領非利士，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"奪取以法蓮和撒瑪利亞；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"便雅憫人將佔領基列。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":20,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被擄的以色列人將佔領迦南人的土地，遠至撒勒法；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"從耶路撒冷被擄到西法拉的人將佔領南地各城。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":21,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"拯救者必登上錫安山，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"統治以掃山，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華必做王掌權。」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":0,"caller":"+","text":"「以掃」又名「以東」。","reference":{"chapter":1,"verse":6}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/OBA/1.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/JON/1.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/AMO/9.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":21}